What Should Not Be Imported

another project's branding or ontology as Pantheon canon;

framework-specific state as the canonical StateVector;

undocumented prompts as Seals;

unscored agent conversations as evidence;

remote install scripts;

secrets, telemetry defaults, or hosted-service dependencies;

code without retained license and source provenance;

mechanisms that duplicate an existing Pantheon primitive without adding evidence or capability.

